WEBVTT

00:02:40.220 --> 00:02:41.210
Aoi-sa-

00:02:42.090 --> 00:02:43.080
I'm ho-

00:02:43.600 --> 00:02:44.260
Ah!

00:02:59.980 --> 00:03:01.660
Since then...

00:03:01.660 --> 00:03:04.490
it's been two years, huh?

00:03:05.750 --> 00:03:07.020
Kaoru!

00:03:07.020 --> 00:03:08.150
Senpai!

00:03:08.150 --> 00:03:09.500
Hanabishi-sama!

00:03:20.560 --> 00:03:21.800
Kaoru-sama!

00:03:46.360 --> 00:03:47.910
I woke up early.

00:04:10.050 --> 00:04:13.810
Kaoru-sama, I'm going to sleep
next to you for a little bit, okay?

00:04:23.590 --> 00:04:24.040
Chi-

00:04:24.630 --> 00:04:25.990
Chika-san?

00:04:32.210 --> 00:04:33.920
Huh? Aoi-chan?

00:04:35.710 --> 00:04:37.200
What's wrong?

00:04:38.610 --> 00:04:39.780
C-Chika-chan!

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:41.330
W-Why are you here?

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.930
K-Kaoru-sama!

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.650
Ah, um... t-that's not it!

00:04:47.650 --> 00:04:48.720
It's not what you think, Aoi-chan!

00:04:50.850 --> 00:04:54.060
Eh, no, that's not what I mean, but...

00:04:54.060 --> 00:04:56.940
I-I mean, um...

00:04:56.940 --> 00:04:58.480
What is going on?

00:04:58.490 --> 00:04:59.580
Miyabi-san!

00:05:01.200 --> 00:05:02.470
What?

00:05:02.470 --> 00:05:04.130
What's going on?

00:05:04.130 --> 00:05:05.120
What happ-

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.770
Chika-chan!

00:05:07.770 --> 00:05:10.580
Ah, Tae Nee-chan, morning.

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:11.810
Honestly!

00:05:11.810 --> 00:05:14.460
W-Why are you in Senpai's futon?

00:05:14.460 --> 00:05:17.420
Well, it was cold last night.

00:05:17.420 --> 00:05:19.380
Because it was cold...

00:05:19.380 --> 00:05:21.680
Okay, I can forgive Chika-rin.

00:05:21.680 --> 00:05:22.850
Yay.

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:24.620
Okay, good night.

00:05:25.920 --> 00:05:27.290
Hey, Chika-chan!

00:05:31.360 --> 00:05:35.270
By the way, Ooya-san{Miss Landlord},
aren't you up awfully early today?

00:05:35.270 --> 00:05:38.100
Eh! Ah, t-that is...

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:42.270
Today is Sunday, so you should have slept more.

00:05:43.820 --> 00:05:46.640
Ah, t-that's so.

00:05:46.640 --> 00:05:48.510
Today is Sunday.

00:05:48.510 --> 00:05:50.830
Oh, I just completely got it wrong.

00:05:53.250 --> 00:05:54.410
Aoi-chan?

00:06:01.460 --> 00:06:03.550
{Thank you for the food}Itadakimasu!

00:06:05.330 --> 00:06:07.800
Today's breakfast is really tasty!

00:06:07.800 --> 00:06:11.300
Not too sweet or spicy.
It's simply miraculous, as always.

00:06:11.300 --> 00:06:13.040
Thank you.

00:06:13.040 --> 00:06:16.510
Huh, this is rape blossom vegetable dish season!

00:06:16.510 --> 00:06:17.440
Kaoru-dono.

00:06:17.440 --> 00:06:17.940
Yes?

00:06:17.940 --> 00:06:20.680
How are your graduate studies going?

00:06:20.680 --> 00:06:22.150
All right, somehow.

00:06:22.150 --> 00:06:23.480
I see.

00:06:23.480 --> 00:06:25.320
That is good to hear.

00:06:25.320 --> 00:06:27.850
It isn't like your undergraduate days.

00:06:27.850 --> 00:06:31.520
So please take care not to be too carefree.

00:06:31.520 --> 00:06:32.070
I will.

00:06:32.490 --> 00:06:35.990
In addition, you may need time to consider this,

00:06:35.990 --> 00:06:38.830
but if you aren't sure of your future, then-

00:06:38.830 --> 00:06:39.670
More, please!

00:06:40.330 --> 00:06:42.700
Chika-rin, nice timing!

00:06:42.700 --> 00:06:44.930
Kanrinin-san's speeches are always long.

00:06:44.930 --> 00:06:45.960
Ah, Aoi-san.

00:06:46.540 --> 00:06:49.570
Chika-chan, get your own food by yourself.

00:06:49.570 --> 00:06:50.870
Ah, I see.

00:06:50.870 --> 00:06:51.550
Yes!

00:06:52.310 --> 00:06:53.300
Thanks for the meal.

00:06:53.300 --> 00:06:55.770
Ah, Kaoru, you're fast today.

00:06:56.180 --> 00:06:58.610
I haven't finished my report yet.

00:06:58.610 --> 00:07:00.510
Aoi-chan, it was delicious.

00:07:02.850 --> 00:07:04.250
So if you'll excuse me.

00:07:05.190 --> 00:07:06.920
{Big Brother}Onii-chan's so nice.

00:07:06.920 --> 00:07:07.740
Truly.

00:07:07.740 --> 00:07:08.320
Yeah.

00:07:09.560 --> 00:07:10.530
Ah, right!

00:07:10.530 --> 00:07:11.030
Ah!

00:07:11.030 --> 00:07:12.130
Hey, hey.

00:07:12.130 --> 00:07:13.160
What?

00:07:13.160 --> 00:07:15.200
I've wanted to ask this for a while.

00:07:15.670 --> 00:07:18.160
Do you {Big Sisters}Onee-chans love {Big Brother}Onii-chan?

00:07:22.670 --> 00:07:24.210
Are you all right, Senpai?

00:07:24.870 --> 00:07:27.250
What the heck are you asking all of the sudden?

00:07:27.910 --> 00:07:31.380
T-That's right, Chika-chan.
Think about what you're asking.

00:07:31.380 --> 00:07:32.520
Why?

00:07:32.520 --> 00:07:34.380
I'm not asking anything strange.

00:07:34.380 --> 00:07:36.790
No, but...

00:07:36.790 --> 00:07:38.060
So what is it?

00:07:38.060 --> 00:07:40.380
Heh? T-That is, um...

00:07:49.000 --> 00:07:50.230
What's wrong?

00:07:50.230 --> 00:07:51.570
Why are you all quiet?

00:07:51.930 --> 00:07:53.540
Hey, do you?

00:07:53.540 --> 00:07:55.450
I-I wonder...

00:07:55.970 --> 00:07:58.010
Do you love him or hate him?

00:07:58.010 --> 00:07:59.370
C-Chika-chan...

00:07:59.370 --> 00:08:01.010
Hey, come on!

00:08:06.980 --> 00:08:07.960
That was such a surprise...

00:08:09.250 --> 00:08:11.210
Chika-san is innocent, isn't she?

00:08:13.300 --> 00:08:14.180
But...

00:08:14.180 --> 00:08:15.190
Ah!

00:08:15.190 --> 00:08:19.220
But I wanted to answer that I love him.

00:08:19.860 --> 00:08:21.180
Aoi-sama.

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:25.170
To say I love Kaoru-sama.

00:08:25.170 --> 00:08:30.440
After all, I'm his fiancée.

00:08:33.410 --> 00:08:37.050
Think of it, we're almost out of rice.

00:08:37.050 --> 00:08:38.160
We'd better buy some.

00:08:38.160 --> 00:08:38.920
Eh!

00:08:38.920 --> 00:08:43.750
But it's heavy, so it would be
better if someone went with you.

00:08:45.120 --> 00:08:46.670
Miyabi-san!

00:08:46.670 --> 00:08:47.890
Hey, hey, hey!

00:08:47.890 --> 00:08:49.690
How do you feel? How do you feel?

00:08:49.690 --> 00:08:52.130
I'm telling you I'm busy right now!

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:54.200
Ah!

00:08:54.800 --> 00:08:56.170
Tae Nee-chan!

00:08:56.170 --> 00:08:58.130
About my question before...

00:08:58.130 --> 00:09:01.220
Oh, so busy, so busy!

00:08:58.140 --> 00:09:01.220
Wait up, Tae Nee-chan!

00:09:01.220 --> 00:09:02.570
She left.

00:09:03.520 --> 00:09:04.480
So?

00:09:07.710 --> 00:09:09.110
Yes, come in.

00:09:17.160 --> 00:09:18.790
Ah, Aoi-chan.

00:09:18.790 --> 00:09:19.950
What's wrong?

00:09:19.950 --> 00:09:21.760
Ah, nothing.

00:09:21.760 --> 00:09:24.260
How is your report coming along?

00:09:24.260 --> 00:09:25.800
It's a bit tight.

00:09:25.800 --> 00:09:29.170
If I don't finish it by tomorrow,
the professor will get mad.

00:09:29.170 --> 00:09:31.100
I see.

00:09:31.100 --> 00:09:33.340
Graduate school must be very hard.

00:09:33.840 --> 00:09:34.670
More than I thought, yes.

00:09:37.110 --> 00:09:38.370
And?

00:09:38.370 --> 00:09:40.180
Wasn't there something you needed?

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:42.410
Eh?! Ah, no.

00:09:42.410 --> 00:09:44.850
Nothing that needs to be done now.

00:09:44.850 --> 00:09:45.560
Really?

00:09:45.560 --> 00:09:46.450
Yes.

00:09:46.450 --> 00:09:48.120
Good luck with your report.

00:09:48.120 --> 00:09:49.720
Yeah, thanks.

00:09:49.720 --> 00:09:50.940
Excuse me then.

00:09:57.360 --> 00:10:00.780
I really shouldn't interfere
with Kaoru-sama's studies.

00:10:10.670 --> 00:10:12.090
Hanabishi-sama!

00:10:12.090 --> 00:10:13.440
M-Mayu-chan!

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:15.260
Mayu came to spend time with you!

00:10:15.780 --> 00:10:16.920
H-Hold on.

00:10:16.920 --> 00:10:17.610
Ah!

00:10:17.610 --> 00:10:18.300
Hanabishi-sama!

00:10:18.300 --> 00:10:19.260
Heh! Again?

00:10:21.800 --> 00:10:24.450
Hey, what are you doing? Honestly!

00:10:24.450 --> 00:10:25.690
Shut up!

00:10:25.690 --> 00:10:29.160
You don't even live here,
but your face always shows up!

00:10:29.160 --> 00:10:32.270
When I come here is all up to Mayu.

00:10:32.270 --> 00:10:33.630
What's with that?

00:10:33.630 --> 00:10:36.030
Your personality hasn't changed at all.

00:10:36.030 --> 00:10:38.900
And you've become even more unrefined.

00:10:38.900 --> 00:10:39.870
What?

00:10:39.870 --> 00:10:41.960
And now I laugh at you!

00:11:17.410 --> 00:11:19.210
Yes, that's right.

00:11:19.210 --> 00:11:25.780
At this point, I think we must conceive a fresh
marketing plan for the Sakura department stores.

00:11:25.780 --> 00:11:27.220
Yes.

00:11:27.220 --> 00:11:30.320
Then we'll revisit this at tomorrow's board meeting.

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:31.550
Excuse me.

00:11:32.560 --> 00:11:33.550
Come in.

00:11:34.460 --> 00:11:35.260
Chika-san.

00:11:35.260 --> 00:11:37.960
I made tea. May I come in?

00:11:40.760 --> 00:11:41.800
Thank you.

00:11:41.800 --> 00:11:42.970
You're welcome.

00:11:43.500 --> 00:11:45.440
And, um...

00:11:45.440 --> 00:11:48.180
Oh, your earlier question?

00:11:49.540 --> 00:11:52.410
Miyabi Onee-chan, do you love {Big Brother}Onii-chan?

00:11:55.520 --> 00:12:01.530
For me, it's not a matter of the feelings of love or hate.

00:12:01.530 --> 00:12:02.150
Heh?!

00:12:02.150 --> 00:12:04.090
Right.

00:12:04.090 --> 00:12:09.370
To me, Kaoru-dono is the bond itself.

00:12:13.830 --> 00:12:15.330
Eh! Shopping?

00:12:15.330 --> 00:12:17.840
Yes, Aoi-san just left by herself.

00:12:28.550 --> 00:12:29.810
Today...

00:12:29.810 --> 00:12:32.580
Ah, I want to go to that new Italian restaurant.

00:12:32.580 --> 00:12:34.620
Italian? Sounds good.

00:12:34.620 --> 00:12:35.780
Doesn't it?

00:12:48.170 --> 00:12:52.630
Maybe I should try wearing some
makeup when I'm with Senpai.

00:12:54.600 --> 00:12:57.420
But it's not like I have any expensive makeup.

00:12:57.810 --> 00:12:59.610
Huh, that's right.

00:12:59.610 --> 00:13:02.050
I bought some new ones, recently.

00:13:04.480 --> 00:13:05.680
Tae Nee-chan!

00:13:05.680 --> 00:13:07.040
I'm coming in!

00:13:13.190 --> 00:13:14.890
T-Tae Nee-chan.

00:13:14.890 --> 00:13:16.530
C-Chika-chan.

00:13:16.530 --> 00:13:18.130
U-Um...

00:13:18.130 --> 00:13:19.300
Wow!

00:13:19.300 --> 00:13:22.560
Tae Nee-chan, those are good luck panties, right?

00:13:22.560 --> 00:13:24.900
Eh, eh! N-No, well...

00:13:24.900 --> 00:13:27.370
Wow, let me see, borrow, and touch them!

00:13:27.370 --> 00:13:28.910
W-Wait, Chika-chan!

00:13:29.740 --> 00:13:31.610
No, don't pull on them!

00:13:32.540 --> 00:13:33.740
I-It tore.

00:13:35.830 --> 00:13:37.400
I'm sorry!

00:13:42.250 --> 00:13:44.240
Maybe I'll take a little nap.

00:13:45.380 --> 00:13:48.060
Ah, Chika, you're so persistent.

00:13:48.060 --> 00:13:48.760
So?

00:13:49.090 --> 00:13:49.550
Eh?!

00:13:49.990 --> 00:13:51.820
Do you love {Big Brother}Onii-chan?

00:13:53.000 --> 00:13:54.080
Love him?

00:13:54.730 --> 00:13:55.800
Do you?

00:13:55.800 --> 00:13:57.630
I don't feel anything for Kaoru!

00:13:57.630 --> 00:13:59.170
So we're just friends!

00:13:59.170 --> 00:13:59.690
I s-s-see!

00:14:00.100 --> 00:14:01.370
I see.

00:14:01.370 --> 00:14:04.110
Right, there's nothing at all.

00:14:04.110 --> 00:14:05.650
B-But...

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.280
T-That's...

00:14:09.280 --> 00:14:10.990
You're really good friends, huh?

00:14:13.750 --> 00:14:15.790
T-Tina Nee-chan?

00:14:15.790 --> 00:14:16.890
Chika-rin!

00:14:16.890 --> 00:14:18.550
W-W-W-What?

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:21.790
Lend me your ear a second.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:22.250
Huh!

00:14:28.430 --> 00:14:33.040
So if you ever talk to anyone else about this...

00:14:33.040 --> 00:14:34.340
O-O-O-O-Okay.

00:14:34.340 --> 00:14:38.270
I p-p-promise I won't tell to a-a-anyone.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:38.810
Yes.

00:14:42.650 --> 00:14:44.150
Why you! Punch!

00:14:45.180 --> 00:14:48.590
Hey, Mayu Nee-chan, listen to me, will you?

00:14:48.590 --> 00:14:51.660
I'm telling you that I'm busy right now!

00:14:51.660 --> 00:14:55.750
There's no way that beast woman
can play this game, and I can't.

00:15:02.000 --> 00:15:05.670
Well, it's okay, since I already know your answer.

00:15:05.670 --> 00:15:08.300
What are you doing, son-in-law?

00:15:17.750 --> 00:15:18.820
Wow!

00:15:18.820 --> 00:15:19.980
Wait up!

00:15:20.980 --> 00:15:22.680
Wow, what's this?

00:15:24.990 --> 00:15:26.400
All right, then...

00:15:30.460 --> 00:15:32.600
It really is a little heavy.

00:15:32.600 --> 00:15:33.450
I'll carry it.

00:15:33.450 --> 00:15:34.030
Eh?!

00:15:35.770 --> 00:15:37.080
Kaoru-sama.

00:15:37.080 --> 00:15:39.100
So you were here, after all.

00:15:39.100 --> 00:15:40.260
Here.

00:15:41.870 --> 00:15:43.420
Strawberry-vanilla is okay, right?

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:46.170
Yes!

00:15:49.780 --> 00:15:51.920
Wow, it's so soft.

00:15:51.920 --> 00:15:52.900
Let's see.

00:16:02.360 --> 00:16:05.400
Wow! Look, look, Kaoru-sama!

00:16:06.570 --> 00:16:08.670
There's so much storage space.

00:16:08.670 --> 00:16:09.570
It's so nice.

00:16:10.930 --> 00:16:13.800
You may need time to consider this,

00:16:13.800 --> 00:16:16.910
but if you don't make sure
to think about your future...

00:16:18.840 --> 00:16:21.000
My future, huh?

00:16:25.980 --> 00:16:26.710
Kaoru-sama?

00:16:27.720 --> 00:16:30.020
W-What, Aoi-chan?

00:16:30.020 --> 00:16:31.470
Is something the matter?

00:16:31.720 --> 00:16:33.750
Ah! N-No, nothing really.

00:16:45.200 --> 00:16:47.770
Kaoru-sama, thank you very much.

00:16:47.770 --> 00:16:49.730
You're busy with your report...

00:16:49.730 --> 00:16:51.690
Well, breaks are important.

00:16:53.780 --> 00:16:55.050
Hey, Aoi-chan.

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:55.590
Yes?

00:16:55.590 --> 00:16:57.950
What kind of house do you want to live in?

00:16:57.950 --> 00:16:59.150
Eh!

00:16:59.150 --> 00:17:00.540
Well, right.

00:17:01.290 --> 00:17:01.910
Ah!

00:17:08.690 --> 00:17:13.700
It looks like the apartment you
lived in before, Kaoru-sama.

00:17:13.700 --> 00:17:15.030
It really does.

00:17:16.930 --> 00:17:18.930
By the way, Aoi-chan.

00:17:18.930 --> 00:17:20.000
Yes?

00:17:20.000 --> 00:17:23.390
It's been two years since then.

00:17:24.670 --> 00:17:28.410
Since we met again, right?

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:03.040
It all started on that day when you came here.

00:18:04.810 --> 00:18:06.510
Kaoru-sama!

00:18:16.630 --> 00:18:18.620
The kind of house doesn't matter.

00:18:19.800 --> 00:18:26.200
No matter how small it may be,
as long as I can be with you, I will be happy.

00:18:27.200 --> 00:18:28.710
Aoi-chan.

00:18:53.060 --> 00:18:54.400
Aoi Onee-chan!

00:18:54.400 --> 00:18:56.500
Ah, Chika-san.

00:18:56.500 --> 00:18:58.030
It's almost ready.

00:18:58.030 --> 00:18:59.760
How do you feel?

00:19:00.740 --> 00:19:02.400
About {Big Brother}Onii-chan.

00:19:03.970 --> 00:19:08.340
Chika-san, do you know the word <i>enishi</i>?

00:19:08.340 --> 00:19:09.410
<i>Enishi?</i>

00:19:09.410 --> 00:19:14.380
Enishi means the bonds
that tie people to one another.

00:19:22.630 --> 00:19:29.570
Everyone here is tied to one another by enishi.

00:19:29.570 --> 00:19:31.060
That is why we all met.

00:19:31.770 --> 00:19:35.970
Of course, Chika-san,
you are also tied to me by enishi.

00:19:35.970 --> 00:19:36.730
Huh!

00:19:37.670 --> 00:19:45.120
So, I believe Kaoru-sama and I have always, always been tied to each other by enishi since long ago.

00:19:48.350 --> 00:19:49.290
So that's it.

00:19:49.290 --> 00:19:49.830
Yes.

00:19:57.230 --> 00:19:58.300
Where's Kaoru?

00:19:58.300 --> 00:19:59.550
He'll be here soon.

00:19:59.860 --> 00:20:00.850
I see.

00:20:01.830 --> 00:20:04.070
Chika-chan, you seem really happy.

00:20:04.070 --> 00:20:06.300
Yeah! After all, I know now!

00:20:08.400 --> 00:20:10.600
About who loves {Big Brother}Onii-chan.

00:20:11.940 --> 00:20:13.850
C-Chika, um...

00:20:13.850 --> 00:20:14.650
Chika-chan!

00:20:16.650 --> 00:20:18.150
Everyone does!

00:20:18.150 --> 00:20:19.320
Eh!

00:20:19.320 --> 00:20:23.200
Everyone loves {Big Brother}Onii-chan! Just like me!

00:20:27.160 --> 00:20:29.990
But the one who loves him most is Mayu.

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:31.230
It's Chika!

00:20:31.230 --> 00:20:32.040
It's me!

00:20:32.410 --> 00:20:33.500
Sorry to keep you waiting.

00:20:33.720 --> 00:20:34.490
Heh?!

00:20:35.630 --> 00:20:37.130
What's wrong everyone?

00:20:37.130 --> 00:20:39.380
Your faces look kind of red.

00:20:39.380 --> 00:20:40.280
Heh!

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:44.370
Come on, let's eat already!

00:20:44.370 --> 00:20:45.640
Right, let's eat!

00:20:45.640 --> 00:20:48.080
I'll sit next to Hanabishi-sama!

00:20:48.080 --> 00:20:50.450
Hey Mayucchi, don't just up and change your seat!

00:20:50.450 --> 00:20:52.750
What I do is up to me!

00:20:52.750 --> 00:20:55.250
What? You little...

00:20:55.250 --> 00:20:56.390
Quiet.

00:20:56.390 --> 00:20:57.550
O-Okay.

00:20:58.820 --> 00:21:00.260
Well, then...

00:21:00.260 --> 00:21:02.280
{Thank you for the food}Itadakimasu!

00:22:35.960 --> 00:22:37.960
Blown in by a new wind,

00:22:38.590 --> 00:22:41.420
they pile up like cherry blossoms.

00:22:41.890 --> 00:22:47.470
I want to take my time and
spin gentle, precious bonds.

00:22:49.370 --> 00:22:53.570
Next time, Ai Yori Aoshi Enishi,

00:22:53.570 --> 00:22:54.890
Friends.

00:22:55.840 --> 00:22:59.320
Aoi will always stay by your side.

00:22:59.900 --> 00:23:01.370
For ever!
